IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbca-core`
IMPORT `cb5-nouns`
IMPORT `cb5-part19-1-damages`
IMPORT `cb5-related-provisions`

-- TESTS of cb5-related-provisions.l4 (src:3543-3604). Every expected value is written from the text of the
-- provision named beside it, before the run; none is copied from the module's output. The coming-into-force
-- days are invented test inputs (the Act's text states none).

§ `Tests of the Related Provisions`

§§ `S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 233 -- Part XIX.1 and proceedings begun before it`

-- Commenced before the day section 115 came into force: Part XIX.1 does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`Part XIX.1 applies to the proceeding within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 233` (YearMonthDay 2001 12 31) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1))
-- Commenced on the day itself, or after: it applies.
#ASSERT `Part XIX.1 applies to the proceeding within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 233` (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1)
#ASSERT `Part XIX.1 applies to the proceeding within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 233` (YearMonthDay 2010 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1)
-- Composed with s 237.2: damages for financial loss, two defendants responsible, an ordinary plaintiff, a later proceeding.
#ASSERT `Part XIX.1 governs the apportionment of the damages` TRUE 2 `any other plaintiff (s 237.2(2))` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2010 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1)
-- One defendant only.
#ASSERT NOT (`Part XIX.1 governs the apportionment of the damages` TRUE 1 `any other plaintiff (s 237.2(2))` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2010 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1))
-- A charity as plaintiff.
#ASSERT NOT (`Part XIX.1 governs the apportionment of the damages` TRUE 2 `a charitable organization, private foundation or public foundation (s 237.2(2)(c))` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2010 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1))
-- A Crown corporation that trades in securities is not excluded.
#ASSERT `Part XIX.1 governs the apportionment of the damages` TRUE 2 `an agent of Her Majesty, a Crown corporation or a government agency (s 237.2(2)(b))` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2010 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1)
-- An old proceeding.
#ASSERT NOT (`Part XIX.1 governs the apportionment of the damages` TRUE 2 `any other plaintiff (s 237.2(2))` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2001 6 1) (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1))

§§ `Transitional rules about proceedings begun before an amendment`

#ASSERT `the proceeding is continued in accordance with the amended provisions within R.S. 1985, c. 27 (2nd Supp.), s. 11` (YearMonthDay 1986 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1987 1 1) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the proceeding is continued in accordance with the amended provisions within R.S. 1985, c. 27 (2nd Supp.), s. 11` (YearMonthDay 1987 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1987 1 1) TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the proceeding is continued in accordance with the amended provisions within R.S. 1985, c. 27 (2nd Supp.), s. 11` (YearMonthDay 1986 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1987 1 1) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the proceeding is taken up and continued under the amended provision within S.C. 1990, c. 17, s. 45(1)` (YearMonthDay 1990 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1991 1 1) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the proceeding is taken up and continued under the amended provision within S.C. 1990, c. 17, s. 45(1)` (YearMonthDay 1992 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1991 1 1) TRUE)
#ASSERT `the proceeding is taken up and continued under the amended provision within S.C. 1998, c. 30, s. 10` (YearMonthDay 1998 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1999 1 1) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the proceeding is taken up and continued under the amended provision within S.C. 1998, c. 30, s. 10` (YearMonthDay 1999 1 1) (YearMonthDay 1999 1 1) TRUE)

§§ `S.C. 1994, c. 21, s. 125(2) -- after 1988`

#ASSERT `subsection 125(1) applies to the year within S.C. 1994, c. 21, s. 125(2)` 1989
#ASSERT `subsection 125(1) applies to the year within S.C. 1994, c. 21, s. 125(2)` 2020
#ASSERT NOT (`subsection 125(1) applies to the year within S.C. 1994, c. 21, s. 125(2)` 1988)
#ASSERT NOT (`subsection 125(1) applies to the year within S.C. 1994, c. 21, s. 125(2)` 1987)

§§ `Reviews of the Act`

-- Three years after assent: assented to on 15 June 1994, the report is in time on 15 June 1997 and late the day after.
#ASSERT `the Minister has laid the report in time within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(1)` (YearMonthDay 1994 6 15) (YearMonthDay 1997 6 15)
#ASSERT NOT (`the Minister has laid the report in time within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(1)` (YearMonthDay 1994 6 15) (YearMonthDay 1997 6 16))
#ASSERT `the committee must review the report and the Act as soon as possible within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(2)(a)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the committee must review the report and the Act as soon as possible within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(2)(a)` FALSE)
-- One year after the laying; a further time authorized replaces it only if later.
#ASSERT `the last day for the committee to report within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(2)(b)` (YearMonthDay 1997 3 1) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 3 1
#ASSERT `the last day for the committee to report within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(2)(b)` (YearMonthDay 1997 3 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 1998 9 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 9 1
#ASSERT `the last day for the committee to report within S.C. 1994, c. 24, s. 33(2)(b)` (YearMonthDay 1997 3 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 1997 9 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 3 1
-- 2001 c 14 s 136: five years after, then every ten years: the first, second and third reviews.
#ASSERT `the last day for the review within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 136` (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1) 1 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2007 1 1
#ASSERT `the last day for the review within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 136` (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1) 2 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2017 1 1
#ASSERT `the last day for the review within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 136` (YearMonthDay 2002 1 1) 3 EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 1 1
#ASSERT `the committee must cause a report to be laid before each House within a reasonable period within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 136` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the committee must cause a report to be laid before each House within a reasonable period within S.C. 2001, c. 14, s. 136` FALSE)
-- 2018 c 8 s 107.1: the fifth anniversary.
#ASSERT `the day Part XIV.1 is to be referred to a committee within S.C. 2018, c. 8, s. 107.1(1)` (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2027 8 1
#ASSERT `the committee must submit a report within a reasonable time within S.C. 2018, c. 8, s. 107.1(2)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the committee must submit a report within a reasonable time within S.C. 2018, c. 8, s. 107.1(2)` FALSE)

§§ `S.C. 1996, c. 10, s. 214 -- previous continuance of railway companies`

#ASSERT `the continuance is not invalid because the company was incorporated by or under an Act of Parliament within S.C. 1996, c. 10, s. 214` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1996 5 1) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 1)
-- Granted on or after the day section 212 came into force: the section does not save it.
#ASSERT NOT (`the continuance is not invalid because the company was incorporated by or under an Act of Parliament within S.C. 1996, c. 10, s. 214` TRUE (YearMonthDay 1996 6 1) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 1))
-- Not a railway company's continuance under section 187.
#ASSERT NOT (`the continuance is not invalid because the company was incorporated by or under an Act of Parliament within S.C. 1996, c. 10, s. 214` FALSE (YearMonthDay 1996 5 1) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 1))

§§ `S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6) -- six months to continue`

-- Six months from 1 March is 1 September.
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for continuance within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2010 9 1
-- Did not apply, and the six months are over: dissolved.
#ASSERT `the body corporate is dissolved on the expiry of the period within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2010 9 2)
-- On the last day itself it is not yet dissolved.
#ASSERT NOT (`the body corporate is dissolved on the expiry of the period within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2010 9 1))
-- Applied in time.
#ASSERT NOT (`the body corporate is dissolved on the expiry of the period within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2010 9 1)) (YearMonthDay 2010 9 2))
-- Applied late: still dissolved at expiry.
#ASSERT `the body corporate is dissolved on the expiry of the period within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2010 9 2)) (YearMonthDay 2010 9 3)
-- Not a body referred to in subsection 297(2).
#ASSERT NOT (`the body corporate is dissolved on the expiry of the period within S.C. 2009, c. 23, s. 297(6)` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2010 3 1) NOTHING (YearMonthDay 2010 9 2))

§§ `S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42 -- application for continuance`

#ASSERT `the Corporation may submit an application for continuance under the Act for the Minister's approval within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)` `the Canada Business Corporations Act (S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)(a))`
#ASSERT `the Corporation may submit an application for continuance under the Act for the Minister's approval within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)` `the Canada Cooperatives Act (S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)(b))`
#ASSERT `the Corporation may submit an application for continuance under the Act for the Minister's approval within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)` `the Canada Not-for-profit Corporations Act (S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)(c))`
#ASSERT NOT (`the Corporation may submit an application for continuance under the Act for the Minister's approval within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1)` `another Act (S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(1))`)
-- Four years from 1 July 2012 is 1 July 2016; a shorter period of 100 days ends sooner; a longer one does not.
#ASSERT `the last day to submit the application to the Minister within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(2)` (YearMonthDay 2012 7 1) NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2016 7 1
#ASSERT `the last day to submit the application to the Minister within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(2)` (YearMonthDay 2012 7 1) (JUST 100) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2012 10 9
#ASSERT `the last day to submit the application to the Minister within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(2)` (YearMonthDay 2012 7 1) (JUST 2000) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2016 7 1
#ASSERT `the Corporation must submit the application to the applicable authorities within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(3)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`the Corporation must submit the application to the applicable authorities within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(3)` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the application is invalid solely because the Corporation is incorporated by an Act of Parliament within S.C. 2011, c. 25, s. 42(4)`

§§ `S.C. 2012, c. 19, s. 210 -- PPP Canada Inc.`

#ASSERT NOT (`PPP Canada Inc. is an agent of Her Majesty in right of Canada within S.C. 2012, c. 19, s. 210` FALSE)
#ASSERT `PPP Canada Inc. is an agent of Her Majesty in right of Canada within S.C. 2012, c. 19, s. 210` TRUE
